From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: office <office@localhost>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0500
Subject: [PATCH] office layer: version snapshot on save and the XDFU watermark

PLAN WP10/WP11 for Slides, on the 0141 hook. The hook gains `wrap` (default: run the command), the engine gains
`register_command` (a command found by id, not listed), and the new ui-egui/src/office_history.rs (desktop only,
installed from main) fills them: a snapshot after file.save/file.saveAs of the document's own file, the Version History
button handler, and with xdfu = on the watermark of every copy of a grif presentation (export in all formats, print,
save as, save as template, file.saveBytes) with the copy number from the audit chain, plus office.xdfu.insertGrif.
Nothing is refused. With xdfu off nothing XDFU exists. print_pdf passes `print: true` so the audit says "print".
